   "id": "johanson-2450at18a100",
   "title": "2450AT18A100E-AEC Mini 2.45 GHz Chip Antenna (AEC-Q200)",
   "partNumber": "2450AT18A100E-AEC",
   "manufacturer": "Johanson Technology",
   "category": "Antenna (chip, 2.4 GHz)",
   "summary": "3.2 × 1.6 mm ceramic chip antenna for the 2.4 GHz ISM band (2400–2500 MHz, ≥9.5 dB return loss), AEC-Q200 qualified and rated −40…+125 °C. On Johanson's evaluation board it reaches 0.5 dBi peak / −0.5 dBi average gain (XZ cut, vertical polarization) with a 1.0 pF / 2.7 nH / 3.9 nH matching network. Use the pattern and link calculators to get gain toward a direction, EIRP against the ETSI/FCC limits, and free-space range.",
   "revision": "Detail specification 12/22/2017, Ver 1.0"
